---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { newsletterConfig } from '../lib/newsletter.mjs';
const { enabled } = newsletterConfig(import.meta.env);
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How GoBK handles information about visitors.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">You can use GoBK without telling us who you are. That is by design.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Reading the Library and newsletter samples requires no account, email, phone number, or payment.</p>
      {enabled ? <p>If you choose to subscribe to The GoBK Guide, the email field sends your email address and newsletter consent directly to Brevo. Brevo processes your subscription and stores your newsletter address for GoBK. This site does not keep a subscriber database. Confirm your email in your inbox before receiving the guide. You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter email.</p> : <p>Newsletter subscriptions are not open in this preview. There is no email-entry form or subscriber database on this site.</p>}
      <p>Do not send account numbers, financial records, court papers, or other private details through newsletter replies.</p>
      <h2>What we do not do</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent visitor information. We do not share newsletter addresses with law firms, debt settlement companies, or anyone else. We do not run advertising trackers on the Library.</p>
      <h2>A plain note about limits</h2>
      <p>No website can promise perfect confidentiality. Your browser, device, network, and search engine keep their own records of where you go. If privacy matters to you, a private browsing window and a personal device are reasonable steps.</p>
      <p class="soft">This policy will be expanded before launch to reflect the specific services GoBK uses.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 44rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-2); }
</style>
